OL,3,CPowerful 7.4 magnitude earthquake
OL,4,Cstrikes Colombia, killing at least 20
OL,6,FAt least 20 people have died and
OL,7,Fdozens of buildings have collapsed
OL,8,Fafter a 7.4 magnitude earthquake hit
OL,9,Fwestern Colombia and parts of
OL,10,Fneighbouring Ecuador.
OL,12,FThe earthquake struck on Monday, with
OL,13,Fits epicentre in San Jose del Palmar,
OL,14,Fa municipality of about 4,800 people
OL,15,Fin Colombia's Choco region, about 250
OL,16,Fmiles west of Bogota, according to the
OL,17,FUS Geological Survey and Colombia's
OL,18,Fgeological service (USGS).
OL,20,FThe USGS said the quake hit at a depth
OL,21,Fof around 66 miles.
