OL,3,CPowerful 7.4 magnitude earthquake
OL,4,Cstrikes Colombia, killing at least 20
OL,6,FLocal officials confirmed that at
OL,7,Fleast 18 people were killed in the
OL,8,Fcity of Pereira and two in Manizales.
OL,10,FThe earthquake trapped residents under
OL,11,Fdebris, left dozens injured, and
OL,12,Fforced people to evacuate their homes
OL,13,Fas far away as the capital, Bogota.
OL,15,FJorge Moncayo, a 64-year-old taxi
OL,16,Fdriver in Colombia's third-largest
OL,17,Fcity, Cali, said he saw plumes of dust
OL,18,Frise across the city from his home in
OL,19,Fthe mountains as buildings collapsed
OL,20,Ffollowing the earthquake.
