OL,3,CPowerful 7.4 magnitude earthquake
OL,4,Cstrikes Colombia, killing at least 20
OL,6,FResidents and rescue workers were
OL,7,Falready searching through the rubble
OL,8,Fof collapsed buildings on Monday
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,F"My entire house shook," he said.
OL,12,F"I've never lived through such a
OL,13,Fpowerful earthquake."
OL,15,FIn Manizales, a city nestled in
OL,16,FColombia's coffee-growing mountains,
OL,17,Fone of the towers of the neo-Gothic
OL,18,Fcathedral collapsed.
