OL,3,CPowerful 7.4 magnitude earthquake
OL,4,Cstrikes Colombia, killing at least 20
OL,6,FMayor Jorge Eduardo Rojas said two
OL,7,Fpeople had died in the city "because
OL,8,Fof the quake" and urged residents to
OL,9,Fremain outside in case of aftershocks.
OL,11,FLocal official Nubia Cordoba said on
OL,12,Fsocial media that "there are injuries
OL,13,Fand serious damage to buildings" in
OL,14,Fthe regional capital of Quibdo, a city
OL,15,Fof about 130,000 people. She did not
OL,16,Fprovide further details.
OL,18,FFootage shared by local media outlets
OL,19,Fshowed homes and small buildings
OL,20,Fcollapsing in the cities of Pereira,
OL,21,FCali, and Quibdo.
