OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FIn Cali, a city of two million people,
OL,12,FMayor Alejandro Eder said residents
OL,13,Fwere trapped in at least 19 collapsed
OL,14,Fbuildings.
OL,16,FThe tremor comes after two back-to-
OL,17,Fback magnitude 7.2 and 7.5 earthquakes
OL,18,Fstruck Venezuela in late June.
